The code in this repository and the derived artifacts it produces are released
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license.

The corpus passages and benchmark questions redistributed in
sample/hgrag4_sample/kg/ (HotpotQA distractor split, Wikipedia text) are
themselves published by their original authors under CC BY-SA 4.0 and are
redistributed here under that same license, unmodified in their annotations.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

